    {
      "id": "e6a1cc75-c98c-4196-b9d8-774797705cf6",
      "title": "Escute a fala completa e acompanhe as três ideias centrais da descrição.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "79d31310-1fcd-4a8a-98f8-a0de331e34a3",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora as duas aparecem na mesma escuta.</p><p><strong>Nora es sociable y alegre.</strong></p><p><strong>Vera es seria y trabajadora.</strong></p><p><strong>Las dos son inteligentes.</strong></p><p>Em português: Nora é sociável e alegre. Vera é séria e trabalhadora. As duas são inteligentes.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6f055516e3fe4cf990575bd4e3785343_b06-nora-y-vera-son-inteligentes.mp3?Expires=1794099420&Signature=RQgAdXb0I4SAFQErcBkyfGDymLNlQJRqF9hzNdPtfYEZPNQ9z8mWPYuTUoSnQ18MjxAmM5oxBmLZwiCJWDCrKxlJxNi3ccwWZnuVwds2RfZP6tZFDcf06GZLCfpspXaGh5K156yxDtvf~WY0J4urLpkA~xJY4vmsCytmHBf2ryNA64vKHkbgBNwQYU9lmFiMY0yQwsYjneREzX5B--oP8FfaTe0yxSOJWK1R3QaxBoUAErc8aLY5euGNFHXjBkf3IDBKomoOZS9jll-aKXiyg3Q5KeYq5Sgc3B-3RsotHTznVXJ6TiwXoXEJKlc3LFXnxJkUAJOMTSZdMxWhYUiP4w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
